        "title": "Ai ringpui tingmik hei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ai ringh pui tingmik hei duidai paeng thang,",
            "Ai ningmei ram gaimei nai e,",
            "Nkhuan ngam makge kanlou meipu ta",
            "Neihlaa na guang kariu nimei tei.",
            "",
            "Zaitang lou o, He ! kanlou meipu",
            "Rimgai mei lily munpuang pui ram.",
            "He, tabui nung rui guang tang ni cho?",
            "Kanlou mei pu tam dat makpui ram.",
            "",
            "2. Ai rui ning liang e poubaomei zianmei,",
            "Zian na ti thai loumei ram tei,",
            "He ! Alungh khou hei guang puang chui lou o.",
            "Ai kapmei le ryanra mei maan ni.",
            "",
            "3. Ata khuan bam e nzianmei nun rui,",
            "Neihla mei ram zion khou tei,",
            "He ! tabui nung rui ai guang tang ni cho?",
            "Tam makpui ram khou thuan kariu khang.",
            "",
            "4. Ata zailou o, He ! kanlou meipu,",
            "Ai rian rapui bam khou ruina,",
            "Ai suan ni lauziu na kagun daimei,",
            "Tam makpui tingsaeng gaipui ramkhou."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
